    <!-- The engine ships its effect names, parameter labels and choice values as
         English `&'static str`, and those strings are also the identity it acts on:
         an id addresses a built-in effect, a (effect id, parameter key) pair
         addresses a parameter, a choice value comes back as its index. EffectsPanel.kt
         maps that identity to these strings at the display site; a miss falls back to
         the engine's own text, so an effect added to rumo-core is still shown, just
         untranslated. Nothing here is ever sent to the engine.
         The English below is deliberately identical to the engine's own spelling —
         including "Colour Tune" and "Reorient Sphere" — so English reads exactly as
         it did before this block existed. Only values-ru/ and values-zh/ differ. -->

